if current_xfail_count > baseline_xfail_count:
    raise TestCountViolation(
        f"xfail count increased from {baseline_xfail_count} to {current_xfail_count}. "
        f"New xfails must use strict=True and be documented (§11.4)."
    )
```

**Condition 5: skip count increases (must be in allowlist)**
```python
if current_skip_count > baseline_skip_count:
    raise TestCountViolation(
        f"Skip count increased from {baseline_skip_count} to {current_skip_count}. "
        f"New skips must be in allowlist with full metadata (§12)."
    )
```

### 13.5 Acceptable count changes

Count increases are ACCEPTABLE and update the baseline:

**New tests added:**
```python
